      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, I don't think you are. You really are just that kind of a person. But thank you for saying it out loud.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T08:09:14.894973+00:00"
    },
    {
