      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow, you really are the type of person I wanted to be with. And thank you for saying that out loud! That means a lot to me.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T08:27:59.983027+00:00"
    },
    {
